</div>\\n\n\\n\n                                                    <p class=\"totals-breakdown-heading\">Approved Work Breakdown</p>\\n\n                        \\n\n                        <div class=\"totals-row\"><span>Labor</span><strong>$0.00</strong></div>\\n\n    \\n\n            <div class=\"totals-row\"><span>Parts</span><strong>$0.00</strong></div>\\n\n    \\n\n\\n\n\\n\n\\n\n\\n\n\\n\n    <div class=\"totals-row totals-row--quiet-final\"><span>Approved</span><span>$0.00</span></div>\\n\n\\n\n                                            </div>\\n\n\\n\n                                    </div>\\n\n            </div>\\n\n\\n\n                            <p class=\"footer-disclosure\"><span>Important:</span> Diagnostic findings are based on conditions observed at the time of inspection. Additional repairs may be required if further issues are discovered during disassembly. Parts and labor are covered by the shop warranty unless otherwise noted. Customer-supplied and used parts may carry no warranty. Pricing is valid for a limited time and may change due to supplier availability. Vehicle may require road testing before and after repairs. Recommendations are based on verified findings and current operating conditions. Further testing or disassembly may change the recommended repair path.</p>\\n\n            \\n\n            \\n\n                                                                <p class=\"footer-disclosure\"><span>Front Brake Service \u00b7 Retail:</span> Warranty: 24-month / 24,000-mile parts and labor. This estimate reflects repairs recommended based on our inspection. Additional concerns may exist that were not apparent during initial evaluation.</p>\\n\n                            \\n\n                                                        <div class=\"repair-portal-ad\">\\n\n                    <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Vehicle portal QR\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\\n\n                    <div class=\"repair-portal-ad